            "block_content": "3. Over the past decade, machine learning has emerged as a prominent subfield of computer science. It is defined by the use of sophisticated mathematical models to allow computers to perform progressively better on their assigned tasks. Machine learning differs from the older field of artificial intelligence, which focused more on modeling abstract intelligence than on applying adaptive computational methods to concrete and solvable problems. For this reason, machine learning has seen great interest from businesses of all sorts.",
